00:11:05.765 --> 00:11:09.902
So let's look through
Hitler's autobiography,

00:11:09.902 --> 00:11:12.772
and political manifesto and
see if we can find anything.

00:11:12.772 --> 00:11:15.875
So I'm reading this book for
the first time in my life,

00:11:15.875 --> 00:11:19.145
and it's shockingly
bad in all regards.

00:11:19.145 --> 00:11:22.348 align:start size:97% position:3%
And you know, you read
chapters one through whatever,

00:11:22.348 --> 00:11:24.183 align:start size:84% position:16%
