on the Communists.

00:11:29.055 --> 00:11:31.691
Eventually, chapter 11,
he's railing on the Jews.

00:11:31.691 --> 00:11:33.726
And then chapter 12, I
turn the page, chapter 12

00:11:33.726 --> 00:11:35.828
and it's like, we
need a movement.

00:11:35.828 --> 00:11:38.197 align:start size:97% position:3%
You know, here's the
answer. We need a movement.

00:11:38.197 --> 00:11:39.732
And I'm reading this chapter 12

00:11:39.732 --> 00:11:42.168
