00:12:20.506 --> 00:12:22.842
That is something
they actually hate.

00:12:22.842 --> 00:12:25.411 align:start size:97% position:3%
The intersectionalists hate
this freedom of choice,

00:12:25.411 --> 00:12:26.912
they're not big on
freedom of choice.

00:12:26.912 --> 00:12:29.849
So that's not real feminism,
that's selling out solidarity.

00:12:29.849 --> 00:12:31.317
So the whole thing became,

00:12:31.317 --> 00:12:33.352
which is what Hitler was
asking for in that chapter.

00:12:33.352 --> 00:12:34.553
'Cause he's got like, you know,

00:12:34.553 --> 00:12:36.222 align:start size:84% position:16%
you have to get
rid of all of your,

00:12:36.222 --> 00:12:37.790 align:start size:84% position:16%
you have to
subordinate your will,

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:40.493
no half measures,
blah, blah, blah,

00:12:40.493 --> 00:12:42.995 align:start size:84% position:16%
and all for solidarity
to our movement.

00:12:42.995 --> 00:12:45.731
So we just rewrote this thing
as intersectional feminism.

00:12:45.731 --> 00:12:48.734
We thought there's no
way anybody's gonna

00:12:48.734 --> 00:12:51.270 align:start size:84% position:16%
take rewritten,
Hitler as feminism.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:54.106 align:start position:0%
And we sent it off to a journal,
